### How to run it right now:

```bash
# 1. Unzip
unzip checkdiff-e2e.zip && cd checkdiff-e2e

# 2. Install & build
npm install
npm run build

# 3. Test on YOUR repo (white-box)
node dist/cli.js run --base main --dry

# 4. Test ANY live website (black-box)
node dist/cli.js run --url https://example.com --dry

# 5. Publish as universal tool
docker build -t checkdiff/checkdiff .
npm publish
```

